Apply a scene's startup hold angles at load, before the first physics step.

Generated against unitree_mujoco ae6a8403e272733e9996ef59990880330496177f, on top of 001-008.
Writes each startup_hold_<joint> angle into qpos at load, so a hand spawned inside a prop does
not sweep through it. Registers vendor/startup_pose in main.cc's three model-load paths and the
build.

